perché la configurazione

00:19:08.900 --> 00:19:09.780
di dev, test e prod

00:19:09.780 --> 00:19:10.680
smette di divergere

00:19:10.680 --> 00:19:11.780
La fiducia diventa

00:19:11.780 --> 00:19:12.180
una metrica

00:19:12.180 --> 00:19:12.760
in un discorso

00:19:12.760 --> 00:19:14.280
La trasparenza unisce tutto

